      "text_raw": "Remember that all these\ncontacts need separate pins.\nAs an example, a supply\nline (or ground line) of a dig-\nital block which runs in par-\nallel with a supply line (or\nground line) of analog\nblock, and gives capacitive\ncoupling.\nA deep diffusion with\nmetal on top between both\nreduces significantly the\ncoupling. Even better, is to\nlead the three bonding wires\nto different pins.",
      "text": "Remember that all these contacts need separate pins. As an example, a supply line (or ground line) of a digital block which runs in parallel with a supply line (or ground line) of analog block, and gives capacitive coupling. A deep diffusion with metal on top between both reduces significantly the coupling. Even better, is to lead the three bonding wires to different pins."
